{
  "description": "Plan 14's system_bodies, body_detail and body_events messages, pinned from both languages, every number at the full precision of its f64, since the server parses floats exactly (serde_json's float_roundtrip, ruling 64.7): the Rust wire-form tests of hyperion-protocol read this file and require every message to round-trip exactly, and @hyperion/protocol's tests decode it. system_bodies_response is the vertical slice's: one Sun-like star, its zone, and two planets whose label, moons and rings are not_modelled, with the system's belts and halo not_modelled. system_bodies_populated exercises every kind, state and section state a later generator version gives, and is shapes, not a generator's output: which sections a destroyed, unbound or not-yet-formed body keeps is P14.T28's and T30's to say. body_events_response has no events, since BodyEventDto has no variant before P14.T31. The body_detail answers are one Earth at three detail levels.",
